      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Contraindicated in pregnancy because conjoined-twin and fetal-harm reports exist, and in porphyria or hepatocellular failure. It reduces hormonal-contraceptive and warfarin effects through enzyme induction. Severe skin reactions, hepatotoxicity, leukopenia and photosensitivity can occur; alcohol may provoke tachycardia/flushing."),
