      description: "Ivermectin is an avermectin antiparasitic and invertebrate glutamate-gated chloride-channel activator that paralyzes susceptible nematodes and ectoparasites; oral tablets treat strongyloidiasis and onchocerciasis, 0.5% lotion kills head lice, 1% cream treats inflammatory rosacea lesions, and oral dosing is commonly used off label for scabies. Channel opening increases chloride influx, hyperpolarizing parasite nerve and muscle until movement, feeding and reproduction fail. Humans lack these channels and therapeutic drug crosses the intact blood-brain barrier poorly. The cream's rosacea benefit is not fully explained and may combine Demodex reduction with anti-inflammatory effects.",
