      boxedWarning: noBoxed("Before oral ivermectin in people with Central/West African exposure, assess possible Loa loa coinfection: heavy microfilaremia has caused serious or fatal encephalopathy. Onchocerciasis treatment can trigger Mazzotti inflammation and ophthalmic reactions. Stop and assess severe neurologic change, hypotension, extensive rash or systemic hypersensitivity."),
