      description: "Topical triamcinolone acetonide is a glucocorticoid anti-inflammatory that binds cytosolic glucocorticoid receptors and changes transcription to suppress cytokines, eicosanoids, edema and pruritus; its real potency depends on concentration, vehicle, body site, barrier integrity and occlusion. It is not a disease-specific cure: the same broad immune suppression can mask infection, thin skin and, over large or occluded areas, suppress the systemic hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis.",
